            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "maraia"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was, indeed, super easy. I served with blanched asparagus. It was convenient to make because I had all of the makings on hand. My friends had fun speculating on the three ingredients that made up this yummy dip.",
